# Release-notes overrides for scripts/release_notes.sh (the beta and stable release bodies, the release PR,
# CHANGELOG.md and TestFlight What to Test). One line per pull request whose own title no longer says what
# users get, because a later PR changed it:
#   #<n> <title>   show <title>, a Conventional Commits title that may end in "(#a, #b)", in place of PR #<n>'s
#   #<n> -         leave PR #<n> out
# Lines that don't start with "#<number> " are comments. Drop the lines once the version they touch is stable.
